Field Type Default Description <code>enabled</code> bool <code>false</code> Register the Google Workspace tool <code>auto_install</code> bool <code>false</code> Register the setup tool even when <code>gws</code> is not on PATH <code>services</code> list <code>["drive", "gmail", "calendar", "sheets"]</code> Workspace services to expose <p>Full example with all options:</p> <pre><code>{
  "tools": {
    "gws": {
      "enabled": true,
      "autoInstall": false,
      "services": ["drive", "gmail", "calendar", "sheets", "docs", "chat"]
    }
  }
}
</code></pre>
